  triage:title "test_dispatch_template_parity.py's SEQUENCE_DOCS is a hardcoded tuple that keeps missing newly added protocol-describing files" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB2-QA3-1789251000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1447#issuecomment-5648745882, 2026-09-12T21:17:10Z; BB2-QA3-M1), reviewed at d2a9b6cc5. .just/tests/test_dispatch_template_parity.py:23-28's SEQUENCE_DOCS is a hardcoded 4-file tuple that missed both AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md (and now quality-management-gh/SKILL.md) this round -- exactly the same class of miss (a first pass claiming 'no other file carries it') that BB2-QA2's ARCH-001 already demonstrated once." ;
