  triage:deferredNote "Recommend replacing the hardcoded tuple with a repo-wide sweep (glob all tracked *.md/*.j2, excluding the test itself) so newly added protocol-describing files are covered automatically rather than requiring a human to remember to append them each round. Routed to fenix on fix/bb2-qa3-r3 (fenix, new top layer, cut from BB.5 @ f232a104c)." ;
